In-app cues
-----------

Copied from UI SFX (https://github.com/romainsimon/uisfx), `cinematic` pack:

- message.ogg / message.mp3        ←  forward
- mention.ogg / mention.mp3        ←  mention
- voice-join.ogg / voice-join.mp3  ←  select
- voice-leave.ogg / voice-leave.mp3 ←  deselect

UI SFX audio is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.
See https://github.com/romainsimon/uisfx/blob/main/LICENSE-AUDIO

Call rings are not files. The client synthesises a dual-tone cadence at
runtime (classic 440/480 Hz), because UI SFX has no ringtone — its loops
are spinner beds (`connecting`, `loading`).
